ParticleOS Container Host is derived from systemd/particleos and is distributed
under LGPL-2.1-or-later. See LICENSE.

The separately built runsc RPM redistributes official gVisor release binaries
under Apache-2.0. Its source archive, checksum, and license are pinned in
.obs/runsc; the installed RPM carries the upstream license text.

The separately signed ipe-policy-containerhost RPM is based on the Linux IPE
policy format and the systemd project's reference packaging, under
GPL-2.0-or-later. Its downstream policy text is maintained in
.obs/ipe-policy-containerhost.
